WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:04.360
If you're a reborn Christian and you&nbsp;
say, well, I don't have self-control,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:09.520
then in a sense you're right because we all&nbsp;
have that sinful fleshly nature within us.&nbsp;

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:14.360
And it's going to be there until the&nbsp;
day we die and it pushes us to do sin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:21.040
like overeating, gluttony, getting angry&nbsp;
and quarrel, or not study, but be lazy.&nbsp;

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:27.920
It is that fleshly nature&nbsp;
within you that brings you down.&nbsp;

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:32.080
But you see, if you are a true reborn Christian,&nbsp;
you have received a new spiritual nature.&nbsp;

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.920
God Himself, the Holy Spirit,&nbsp;
came and lives inside of you.&nbsp;

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:40.960
You see, there is a change and now&nbsp;
you can choose to live through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:44.680
Spirit and the Spirit can overcome the flesh.&nbsp;

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:49.520
And it is the only power that&nbsp;
can overcome the sinful nature.

